			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Minify ESBuild configuration files\n\nThe ESBuild configuration files in the Cocoon component have been minified to reduce bundle size and improve build performance. This change affects all configuration files in the Configuration/ESBuild directory, including Bootstrap.js, Cocoon.js, and related target configurations.\n\nThe minification process involved shortening variable names and removing unnecessary whitespace and comments while preserving functionality. This optimization reduces the overall size of the configuration files without impacting their behavior.",
